o Sánchez,bAlfredo  aFCN-UNTbSNAcPREShA76 M363c92 ej.  3ej. 18PRESbSNAcPRESg13oA76 M363cp00007295yTEXTO  3ej. 18PRESbSNAcPRESoA76 M363cp00007296yTEXTO00474nab a2200169   4500001001200000003000800012005001700020008004100037035002500078040002600103336002700129337002800156338002800184773002500212852003000237952003700267SNA00003644FCN-UNT20261106000000.0001018n########xx#           000 0 spad   a(FCN-UNT)SNA00003644  aFCN-UNTbspacFCN-UNT  atextobtxt2rdacontent  ano mediadobn2rdamedia  avolumenbnc2rdacarrier0 w(FCN-UNT)SNA00003543  aFCN-UNTbSNAcPRES92 ej.  3ej. 28PRESbSNAcPRESp0000729601523nam a2200421   SNA00003645FCN-UNT20261106000000.0001018s1999####ar#a          000 0 spad   a(FCN-UNT)SNA00003645  aFCN-UNTbspacFCN-UNT  aspa  aar#  a663.12  aG589e1 aGonzález,bClaudio Fabricio10aEstudio de levaduras amilolíticas de interés industrial: aspectos básicos y aplicados  aTucumánbUniversidad Nacional de Tucumán, Facultad de Ciencias Naturales e Instituto Miguel Lilloc1999  a104 h.bil., fig., tabl. ; 30 cm.  atextobtxt2rdacontent  ano mediadobn2rdamedia  avolumenbnc2rdacarrier0 aBibliografía: h. 97-1040 anº de orden interno: TD Biología: 001  aTESIS -- Universidad Nacional de Tucumán, Facultad de Ciencias Naturales e Instituto Miguel Lillo -- Doctor en Biología -- 1999.  aBIOLOGIA.9FCN-UNT  aMICROBIOLOGIA.9FCN-UNT  aLEVADURAS.9FCN-UNT  aFERMENTOS.9FCN-UNT  aALFA-AMILASA.9FCN-UNT  aGLUCOAMILASA.9FCN-UNT  aLEVADURAS (MENOS PROTEASA).9FCN-UNT  aMANDIOCA.9FCN-UNT  aTAPIOCA.9FCN-UNT  aYUCA.9FCN-UNT  aTESIS.9FCN-UNT  aFCN-UNTbSNAcPREShG589e91 ej.  3ej. 18PRESbSNAcPRESg40oG589ep00007297yTEXTO02729nam a2200397   SNA00003646FCN-UNT20261106000000.0001019s1963####ar#a          000 0 spad   a(FCN-UNT)SNA00003646  aFCN-UNTbspacFCN-UNT  aspa  aar#  a595.76 (82)  aM3131 aManfrini de Brewer,bMireya10aContribución al conocimiento de las ripiphoridae argentinas (coleoptera)3 aOpera Lilloana XI  aTucumánbUniversidad Nacional de Tucumán, Esc. Univ. de Ciencias Naturales del Inst. Miguel Lilloc1963  a106 p.bil. ; 24 cm.  atextobtxt2rdacontent  ano mediadobn2rdamedia  avolumenbnc2rdacarrier0 aBibliografía: p. 101-1040 anº de orden interno: TDZ-1  aTESIS -- Universidad Nacional de Tucumán, Escuela Universitaria de Ciencias Naturales del Instituto Miguel Lillo -- Doctora en Zoología -- 1963.  aContribution to a knowledge of the Ripiphoridae (Coleoptera) of Argentina.- The present paper deals with the Ripiphoridae of the Argentine Republic and is divided into two parts.- In the first part, following a short introduction, reference is made to the morphology of the adults of this family giving examples of some of its genera and this is followed by notes on the biology of some of the species for which data is available.- The second part consist of a taxonomic study of the family with a key for the separation of the subfamilies. The genera Trigonodera and Elytroxystrotus nov. belonging to the subfamily Pelacotaninae are described in detail with keys for their respective species. The general structure of the adults of the genus Trigonodera is studied and compared with that of the species Trigonodera signaticollis Gerstaecker which is fully described and ilustrated.- A new genus under the name Elytroxystrotus is proposed for the species Pelecotomoides griseovittata Pic (1926) and five new species, of Trigonodera, haywardi, variegata, crassa, bicolor and quadrilineata, are described, all from Argentina. Localities for all the material studied are given and the paper concludes with a list of the principal publications referring to this family.-  aZOOLOGIA.9FCN-UNT  aTESIS.9FCN-UNT  aRIPIPHORIDAE.9FCN-UNT  aCOLEOPTERA.9FCN-UNT  aManfrini de Brewer,bMireya2 aUniversidad Nacional de Tucumán. Instituto Miguel Lillo  aFCN-UNTbSNAcPREShM31392 e